[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13980.79, "timestamp": "03:53:00", "text": "心配事を解消する。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13982.63, "timestamp": "03:53:02", "text": "えっと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13985.11, "timestamp": "03:53:05", "text": "最近体調が悪いのですが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13989.429, "timestamp": "03:53:09", "text": "そして私は明日以降はそこにいません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13991.189, "timestamp": "03:53:11", "text": "夕方。では、最後にもう一度配信します"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13993.51, "timestamp": "03:53:13", "text": "家に帰る前に。私は必要とする"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13998.07, "timestamp": "03:53:18", "text": "それについて告知をす​​るため。それで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14001.189, "timestamp": "03:53:21", "text": "やってみよう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14004.95, "timestamp": "03:53:24", "text": "まだ64歳。64歳だったっけ？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14011.269, "timestamp": "03:53:31", "text": "なぜなら、この32も32はそうではなかったから"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14014.71, "timestamp": "03:53:34", "text": "ええと、とてもがらんとしていました。手に入れることができなかった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14018.79, "timestamp": "03:53:38", "text": "殺したり、その他何でも。人を見かけなかった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14023.189, "timestamp": "03:53:43", "text": "しかし、Discord ba には 2 つあります。うん、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14025.269, "timestamp": "03:53:45", "text": "そのサーバーをアクティブにしたい"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14027.269, "timestamp": "03:53:47", "text": "しかし、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14029.75, "timestamp": "03:53:49", "text": "ただ、みんな、みんな"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14032.71, "timestamp": "03:53:52", "text": "場所によって異なる。誰もが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14036.71, "timestamp": "03:53:56", "text": "最近は忙しい。もっと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14039.99, "timestamp": "03:53:59", "text": "バンバンバン"}]